items.Ingredient_Nakasar_Philosophers_Salt.name = Philosopher's Salt
items.Ingredient_Nakasar_Philosophers_Salt.description = The principle of body, which fixes and hardens. The Alchemist's golems and flasks are kneaded from it.
items.Ingredient_Nakasar_Burning_Sulfur.name = Burning Sulfur
items.Ingredient_Nakasar_Burning_Sulfur.description = The principle of soul, which burns and transforms. It still smoulders inside fire and thunder elementals.
items.Ingredient_Nakasar_Quicksilver.name = Quicksilver
items.Ingredient_Nakasar_Quicksilver.description = The principle of spirit, which flows and binds. It runs through the veins of homunculi and apprentices.
