items.Nakasar_Philosopher_Stone.name = Philosopher's Stone
items.Nakasar_Philosopher_Stone.description = The Alchemist's Great Work, a warm red stone that throbs like a heart. Many have coveted it.
items.Nakasar_Philosopher_Pedestal_Stone.name = Philosopher's Stone Pedestal
items.Nakasar_Philosopher_Pedestal_Stone.description = The philosopher's stone rests on its velvet cushion. Every time someone takes it, it is still there.
items.Nakasar_Alchemist_Bag.name = Alchemist's Satchel
items.Nakasar_Alchemist_Bag.description = The Alchemist's leather satchel, heavy with flasks and reagents. Right-click to open.
items.Nakasar_Alchemist_Bag_Hard.name = Satchel of the Great Work
items.Nakasar_Alchemist_Bag_Hard.description = The satchel the Alchemist kept for the Great Work, filled to bursting. Right-click to open.
items.Potion_Nakasar_Bottomless_Flask.name = Bottomless Flask
items.Potion_Nakasar_Bottomless_Flask.description = A pewter flask that refills itself with a red elixir. You must wait for it to refill between sips.
items.Armor_Nakasar_Alchemist_Gloves.name = Alchemist's Gloves
items.Armor_Nakasar_Alchemist_Gloves.description = Thick leather gloves stained with acid and soot. Flasks thrown with them fly further.
items.Nakasar_Elemental_Lantern.name = Elemental Lantern
items.Nakasar_Elemental_Lantern.description = A brass lantern where fire, frost, lightning and roots burn in turn.
items.Armor_Nakasar_Alchemist_Goggles.name = Alchemist's Goggles
items.Armor_Nakasar_Alchemist_Goggles.description = The violet-lensed goggles the Alchemist wore under his mask.
items.Potion_Nakasar_Grand_Elixir.name = Grand Elixir
items.Potion_Nakasar_Grand_Elixir.description = A greater health potion refined with salt and mercury. Heals at once, then keeps healing.
items.Potion_Nakasar_Elemental_Ward.name = Elemental Ward
items.Potion_Nakasar_Elemental_Ward.description = An iridescent potion that shields against fire, frost, lightning and poison.
items.Potion_Nakasar_Quicksilver_Draught.name = Quicksilver Draught
items.Potion_Nakasar_Quicksilver_Draught.description = A stamina potion with mercury rolling inside. Restores all stamina and raises it for a long time.
